e','','none'),(7032,'WARNING: You are not using an encrypted connection, so your password will be sent in plain text. <a href=\":https-link\">Learn more</a>.','','none'),(7033,'The form has become outdated. Copy any unsaved work in the form below and then <a href=\":link\">reload this page</a>.','','none'),(7034,'@name cannot be longer than %max characters but is currently %length characters long.','','none'),(7035,'All necessary changes to %dir and %file have been made, so you should remove write permissions to them now in order to avoid security risks. If you are unsure how to do so, consult the <a href=\":handbook_url\">online handbook</a>.','','none'),(7036,'The system will notify you when updates and important security releases are available for installed components. Anonymous information about your site is sent to <a href=\":drupal\">Drupal.org</a>.','','none'),(7037,'File Transfer failed, reason: @reason','','none'),(7038,'Unique field constraint','Validation','none'),(7039,'A @entity_type with @field_name %value already exists.','','none'),(7040,'The Aggregator module is an on-site syndicator and news reader that gathers and displays fresh content from RSS-, RDF-, and Atom-based feeds made available across the web. Thousands of sites (particularly news sites and blogs) publish their latest headlines in feeds, using a number of standardized XML-based formats. For more information, see the <a href=\":aggregator-module\">online documentation for the Aggregator module</a>.','','none'),(7041,'Administrators can add, edit, and delete feeds, and choose how often to check each feed for newly updated items on the <a href=\":feededit\">Feed aggregator page</a>.','','none'),(7042,'Configuring the display of feed items','','none'),(7043,'Discarding old feed items','','none'),(7044,'A <a href=\":aggregator-opml\">machine-readable OPML file</a> of all feeds is available. OPML is an XML-based file format used to share outline-structured information such as a list of RSS feeds. Feeds can also be <a href=\":import-opml\">imported via an OPML file</a>.','','none'),(7045,'A working <a href=\":cron\">cron maintenance task</a> is required to update feeds automatically.','','none'),(7046,'Current feeds are listed below, and <a href=\":addfeed\">new feeds may be added</a>. For each feed, the <em>latest items</em> block may be enabled at the <a href=\":block\">blocks administration page</a>.','','none'),(7047,'Feed aggregator settings','','none'),(7048,'@title feed','','none'),(7049,'No feeds available. <a href=\":link\">Add feed</a>.','','none'),(7050,'The length of time between feed updates. Requires a correctly configured <a href=\":cron\">cron maintenance task</a>.','','none'),(7051,'Requires a correctly configured <a href=\":cron\">cron maintenance task</a>.','','none'),(7052,'Administrators can enter IP addresses to ban on the <a href=\":bans\">IP address bans</a> page.','','none'),(7053,'Block settings updated.','','none'),(7054,'Edit %label custom block type','','none'),(7055,'Block with uuid %uuid does not exist. <a href=\":url\">Add custom block</a>.','','none'),(7056,'Add a <a href=\":url\">custom block</a>.','','none'),(7057,'Book pages have a default book-specific navigation block. This navigation block contains links that lead to the previous and next pages in the book, and to the level above the current page in the book\'s structure. This block can be enabled on the <a href=\':admin-block\'>Blocks layout page</a>. For book pages to show up in the book navigation, they must be added to a book outline.','','none'),(7058,'The outline feature allows you to include pages in the <a href=\":book\">Book hierarchy</a>, as well as move them within the hierarchy or to <a href=\":book-admin\">reorder an entire book</a>.','','none'),(7059,'The parent page in the book. The maximum depth for a book and all child pages is @maxdepth. Some pages in the selected book may not be available as parents if selecting them would exceed this limit.','','