nformation, changes of email addresses and passwords, issuing emails to users and blocking and deleting user accounts.','','8.1.9'),(8057,'Permissions let you control what users can do and see on your site. You can define a specific set of permissions for each role. (See the <a href=\":role\">Roles</a> page to create a role.) Any permissions granted to the Authenticated user role will be given to any user who is logged in to your site. From the <a href=\":settings\">Account settings</a> page, you can make any role into an Administrator role for the site, meaning that role will be granted all new permissions automatically. You should be careful to ensure that only trusted users are given this access and level of control of your site.','','8.1.9'),(8058,'Menu links','','8.1.7'),(8059,'List of @type values','','8.1.9'),(8060,'Flag actions','','8.1.7'),(8061,'Flaggings','','8.1.7'),(8062,'Image with image style','','8.1.9'),(8063,'Array','','8.1.7'),(8064,'@flag flag count','','8.1.7'),(8065,'@flag flag link','','8.1.7'),(8066,'Translation source node','','8.1.7'),(8067,'Original @entity','','8.1.7'),(8068,'Parents','','8.1.7'),(8069,'Root term','','8.1.7'),(8070,'File byte size','','8.1.7'),(8071,'Base name','','8.1.7'),(8072,'One-time login URL','','8.1.7'),(8073,'Account cancellation URL','','8.1.7'),(8074,'Root','','8.1.7'),(8075,'Link ID','','8.1.7'),(8076,'Page number','','8.1.7'),(8077,'Query string value','','8.1.7'),(8078,'Absolute URL','','8.1.7'),(8079,'Relative URL','','8.1.7'),(8080,'Unaliased URL','','8.1.7'),(8081,'Brief URL','','8.1.7'),(8082,'Last','','8.1.7'),(8083,'First','','8.1.7'),(8084,'Keys','','8.1.7'),(8085,'Imploded','','8.1.7'),(8086,'Joined path','','8.1.7'),(8087,'Flag title','','8.1.7'),(8088,'Flag name','','8.1.7'),(8089,'Flagging date','','8.1.7'),(8090,'Flag entity title','','8.1.7'),(8091,'Flag entity URL','','8.1.7'),(8092,'Flag action','','8.1.7'),(8093,'Flag entity type','','8.1.7'),(8094,'Flag count','','8.1.7'),(8095,'Flag entity 